### 1. Create Opted-in User (For Movie release & booking alerts)
POST http://localhost:8081/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "optedInForNotifications": true,
  "name": "Nitu",
  "email": "[EMAIL_ADDRESS]"
}

### 2. Create Cinema
POST http://localhost:8081/cinemas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "PVR Cinemas",
  "city":  "Bengaluru",
  "address": "Forum Mall, Koramangala"
}

### 3. Create Hall
POST http://localhost:8081/halls
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Audi 1",
  "capacity": 100,
  "cinemaId": 1
}

### 4. Create Movie (Triggers New Movie Release Notification to opted-in users! - R14)
POST http://localhost:8081/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Interstellar",
  "language": "English",
  "genre": "Sci-Fi",
  "releaseDate": "2026-11-10",
  "duration": 169
}

### 5. Add Seat 1 to Hall 1
POST http://localhost:8081/seats
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hallId": 1,
  "seatNumber": "A1",
  "seatType": "GOLD",
  "price": 250.0
}

### 6. Add Seat 2 to Hall 1
POST http://localhost:8081/seats
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hallId": 1,
  "seatNumber": "A2",
  "seatType": "GOLD",
  "price": 250.0
}

### 7. Add Seat 3 to Hall 1 (For modification test)
POST http://localhost:8081/seats
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hallId": 1,
  "seatNumber": "A3",
  "seatType": "PLATINUM",
  "price": 400.0
}

### 8. Create Show
POST http://localhost:8081/shows
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movieId": 1,
  "hallId": 1,
  "startTime": "2026-11-10T18:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-11-10T21:00:00"
}

### 9. View Available Show Seats
GET http://localhost:8081/show-seats/show/1

### 10. Book Online with Credit Card (SUCCESS - R6, R7, R14)
POST http://localhost:8081/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "showId": 1,
  "seatIds": [1, 2],
  "bookingSource": "ONLINE",
  "paymentMethod": "CREDIT_CARD"
}

### 11. Book via Ticket Agent with Cash (SUCCESS - R6, R7)
POST http://localhost:8081/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "showId": 1,
  "seatIds": [3],
  "bookingSource": "AGENT",
  "paymentMethod": "CASH"
}

### 12. Try Online Booking with CASH (EXPECTED FAILURE: 500 - R7 validation)
POST http://localhost:8081/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "showId": 1,
  "seatIds": [3],
  "bookingSource": "ONLINE",
  "paymentMethod": "CASH"
}

### 13. Modify Booking 1 (Replaces seats with seat 3 - R15)
PUT http://localhost:8081/bookings/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newSeatIds": [1]
}

### 14. Cancel Booking 1 (Releases seats back to AVAILABLE - R14)
DELETE http://localhost:8081/bookings/1
